<title>UK: Goldman Sachs set warrants on SuperCyclical basket.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs set warrants on SuperCyclical basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Wertpapier says it has issued 10 million American-style call warrants, on the GS SuperCyclical basket comprising Cementos De Mexico SA, Daimler-Benz AG, Hoechst AG, Georgia-Pacific Corp, Sony Corp, Dow Chemical Co, AMR Corp, Philips Electronics NV, General Motors Corp, Koninklijke Nederlandsche Hoogovens Staalfabriek.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,000.00 DEM	    PREMIUM	13.75 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.375 DEM		 GEARING	7.27 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 07.MAY.97-20.OCT.98   PAYDATE	06.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   DDF FFT STG	     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1,000.00 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
